---
interface Props { landing?: boolean }
const { landing=false }=Astro.props;
---
<div class="faq-layout wrap">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p>
<h2>{landing ? <>Your journal,<br />your way.</> : <>Before your<br />next catch.</>}</h2>
<p class="muted">A little clarity before you begin.</p>
</div>
<div class="questions">
<details>
<summary>Can I log a catch without a photo?</summary>
<p>Yes. Choose “Add without a photo” and enter the catch yourself. Fish identification is optional.</p>
</details>
<details data-journal-protection>
<summary>Do I need an account to start?</summary>
<p>No account is needed to start recording catches. Optional Journal Protection uses Google sign-in.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>What will my Insights show?</summary>
<p>Explore personal records, fishing locations and patterns based on your recorded catches. Some views need enough saved data. They do not measure fishing effort or catch rates.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Can a fish suggestion be wrong?</summary>
<p>Yes. Photo identification suggests a likely species and can be uncertain. Check the result and change the species if needed.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Is CatchID free?</summary>
<p>CatchID is free to download on Android. The app includes advertising.</p>
</details>
</div>
</div>
